{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-tunnel-config","title":"域名与隧道配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services/domain-tunnel-config","wordCount":903,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"域名与隧道配置\">域名与隧道配置</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Homelab 搭建完成后面临一个核心问题：如何从外部网络安全地访问家里的服务？传统方案需要公网 IP + 端口转发 + DDNS，但 2026 年更优雅的方案是 Cloudflare Tunnel——无需暴露任何端口、无需公网 IP，通过出站连接建立加密隧道即可实现安全的公网访问。本文从域名配置开始，对比各种远程访问方案，提供一套兼顾安全性和便利性的完整配置指南。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"远程访问方案对比\">远程访问方案对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>配置复杂度</th>\n<th>需要公网 IP</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>端口转发 + DDNS</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>不推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloudflare Tunnel</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Web 服务公网访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tailscale</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>个人设备间访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WireGuard (自建)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>完全自主控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ZeroTier</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>多设备组网</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"cloudflare-tunnel-工作原理\">Cloudflare Tunnel 工作原理</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as &quot;外部用户&quot;&#10;    participant CF as &quot;Cloudflare Edge&quot;&#10;    participant Tunnel as &quot;cloudflared (家中)&quot;&#10;    participant Service as &quot;本地服务&quot;&#10;&#10;    Tunnel-&gt;&gt;CF: 建立出站隧道连接&#10;    Note over Tunnel,CF: 从家中主动连接 Cloudflare&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;CF: 访问 app.yourdomain.com&#10;    CF-&gt;&gt;CF: SSL 终结 + WAF 防护&#10;    CF-&gt;&gt;Tunnel: 通过隧道转发请求&#10;    Tunnel-&gt;&gt;Service: 转发到 localhost:8080&#10;    Service-&gt;&gt;Tunnel: 返回响应&#10;    Tunnel-&gt;&gt;CF: 通过隧道回传&#10;    CF-&gt;&gt;User: 返回加密响应\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as \"外部用户\"\n    participant CF as \"Cloudflare Edge\"\n    participant Tunnel as \"cloudflared (家中)\"\n    participant Service as \"本地服务\"\n\n    Tunnel-&gt;&gt;CF: 建立出站隧道连接\n    Note over Tunnel,CF: 从家中主动连接 Cloudflare\n    User-&gt;&gt;CF: 访问 app.yourdomain.com\n    CF-&gt;&gt;CF: SSL 终结 + WAF 防护\n    CF-&gt;&gt;Tunnel: 通过隧道转发请求\n    Tunnel-&gt;&gt;Service: 转发到 localhost:8080\n    Service-&gt;&gt;Tunnel: 返回响应\n    Tunnel-&gt;&gt;CF: 通过隧道回传\n    CF-&gt;&gt;User: 返回加密响应</pre><p>关键优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零端口暴露</strong>：路由器不需要开放任何入站端口</li>\n<li><strong>无需公网 IP</strong>：即使在 NAT 后面也能工作</li>\n<li><strong>自带 DDoS 防护</strong>：Cloudflare 的 Edge 网络天然屏蔽攻击</li>\n<li><strong>自动 HTTPS</strong>：Cloudflare 管理证书，无需 Let&#39;s Encrypt</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"域名-dns-架构\">域名 DNS 架构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"yourdomain.com (Cloudflare DNS)&#10;├── A/AAAA     → Cloudflare Proxy (公网服务)&#10;├── CNAME      → tunnel-id.cfargotunnel.com (隧道服务)&#10;└── 本地 DNS   → Pi-hole/AdGuard Home (内网解析)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>yourdomain.com (Cloudflare DNS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── A/AAAA     → Cloudflare Proxy (公网服务)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── CNAME      → tunnel-id.cfargotunnel.com (隧道服务)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 本地 DNS   → Pi-hole/AdGuard Home (内网解析)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"步骤一-域名注册与-cloudflare-配置\">步骤一：域名注册与 Cloudflare 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 在 Cloudflare 注册域名（或将现有域名 NS 切换到 Cloudflare）&#10;# 推荐: .com / .dev / .app 后缀&#10;&#10;# 2. 在 Cloudflare Dashboard 添加站点&#10;# Zone Settings → SSL/TLS → Full (Strict)&#10;# Zone Settings → Edge Certificates → Always Use HTTPS: ON&#10;&#10;# 3. 获取 API Token (用于自动化)&#10;# My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token&#10;# Template: Edit zone DNS\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 在 Cloudflare 注册域名（或将现有域名 NS 切换到 Cloudflare）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 推荐: .com / .dev / .app 后缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 在 Cloudflare Dashboard 添加站点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Zone Settings → SSL/TLS → Full (Strict)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Zone Settings → Edge Certificates → Always Use HTTPS: ON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 获取 API Token (用于自动化)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Template: Edit zone DNS</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤二-安装-cloudflare-tunnel\">步骤二：安装 Cloudflare Tunnel</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# /opt/homelab/cloudflared/docker-compose.yml&#10;services:&#10;  cloudflared:&#10;    image: cloudflare/cloudflared:latest&#10;    container_name: cloudflared&#10;    restart: unless-stopped&#10;    command: tunnel run&#10;    environment:&#10;      - TUNNEL_TOKEN=${TUNNEL_TOKEN}&#10;    networks:&#10;      - proxy&#10;&#10;networks:&#10;  proxy:&#10;    external: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># /opt/homelab/cloudflared/docker-compose.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cloudflared</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cloudflare/cloudflared:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    container_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cloudflared</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unless-stopped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tunnel run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TUNNEL_TOKEN=${TUNNEL_TOKEN}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    networks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">proxy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">networks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  proxy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    external</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通过 Cloudflare Dashboard 创建隧道更方便（Zero Trust → Access → Tunnels → Create）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 或者用 CLI 创建&#10;docker run cloudflare/cloudflared:latest tunnel login&#10;docker run cloudflare/cloudflared:latest tunnel create homelab&#10;&#10;# 获取 Tunnel Token 后设置到 .env&#10;echo &quot;TUNNEL_TOKEN=your-tunnel-token&quot; &gt;&gt; /opt/homelab/.env\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或者用 CLI 创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cloudflare/cloudflared:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tunnel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cloudflare/cloudflared:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tunnel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> create</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> homelab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 获取 Tunnel Token 后设置到 .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"TUNNEL_TOKEN=your-tunnel-token\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /opt/homelab/.env</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤三-配置公网路由规则\">步骤三：配置公网路由规则</h3><p>在 Cloudflare Zero Trust Dashboard 中配置 Public Hostname：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Subdomain</th>\n<th>Service</th>\n<th>URL</th>\n<th>保护</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vault</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>localhost:8080</td>\n<td>无（Vaultwarden 自带认证）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cloud</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>localhost:8888</td>\n<td>无（Nextcloud 自带认证）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>photos</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>localhost:2283</td>\n<td>Cloudflare Access</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n8n</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>localhost:5678</td>\n<td>Cloudflare Access</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"步骤四-cloudflare-access-保护敏感服务\">步骤四：Cloudflare Access 保护敏感服务</h3><p>对不自带强认证的服务，添加 Cloudflare Access 策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Zero Trust → Access → Applications → Add Application&#10;├── Self-hosted&#10;├── Application domain: n8n.yourdomain.com&#10;├── Policy: Allow&#10;│   └── Include: Emails ending in @youremail.com&#10;│   └── Require: One-time PIN (email verification)&#10;└── Session duration: 24 hours\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Zero Trust → Access → Applications → Add Application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Self-hosted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Application domain: n8n.yourdomain.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Policy: Allow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Include: Emails ending in @youremail.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Require: One-time PIN (email verification)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Session duration: 24 hours</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤五-tailscale-内网组网\">步骤五：Tailscale 内网组网</h3><p>对不需要公网访问的管理服务，用 Tailscale 组建私有网络：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# /opt/homelab/tailscale/docker-compose.yml&#10;services:&#10;  tailscale:&#10;    image: tailscale/tailscale:latest&#10;    container_name: tailscale&#10;    restart: unless-stopped&#10;    hostname: homelab&#10;    cap_add:&#10;      - NET_ADMIN&#10;      - SYS_MODULE&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./state:/var/lib/tailscale&#10;      - /dev/net/tun:/dev/net/tun&#10;    environment:&#10;      - TS_AUTHKEY=${TAILSCALE_AUTHKEY}&#10;      - TS_STATE_DIR=/var/lib/tailscale&#10;      - TS_EXTRA_ARGS=--advertise-exit-node --advertise-routes=192.168.1.0/24&#10;    network_mode: host\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># /opt/homelab/tailscale/docker-compose.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tailscale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tailscale/tailscale:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    container_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tailscale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unless-stopped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    hostname</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">homelab</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cap_add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NET_ADMIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SYS_MODULE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./state:/var/lib/tailscale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/dev/net/tun:/dev/net/tun</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TS_AUTHKEY=${TAILSCALE_AUTHKEY}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TS_STATE_DIR=/var/lib/tailscale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">TS_EXTRA_ARGS=--advertise-exit-node --advertise-routes=192.168.1.0/24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    network_mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">host</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Tailscale 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有设备（手机、笔记本、服务器）自动组网</li>\n<li>WireGuard 协议，性能接近直连</li>\n<li>MagicDNS：用 <code>homelab.tail-xxx.ts.net</code> 访问服务</li>\n<li>无需域名和证书</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"步骤六-let-s-encrypt-通配符证书\">步骤六：Let&#39;s Encrypt 通配符证书</h3><p>如果使用 Traefik 而非 Cloudflare Tunnel（如纯内网场景）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Traefik 配置自动申请通配符证书&#10;certificatesResolvers:&#10;  letsencrypt:&#10;    acme:&#10;      email: your@email.com&#10;      storage: /certs/acme.json&#10;      dnsChallenge:&#10;        provider: cloudflare&#10;        resolvers:&#10;          - &#39;1.1.1.1:53&#39;&#10;&#10;# 通配符证书路由&#10;http:&#10;  routers:&#10;    wildcard:&#10;      rule: &#39;HostRegexp(`{subdomain:.+}.yourdomain.com`)&#39;&#10;      tls:&#10;        certResolver: letsencrypt&#10;        domains:&#10;          - main: &#39;yourdomain.com&#39;&#10;            sans:&#10;              - &#39;*.yourdomain.com&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Traefik 配置自动申请通配符证书</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">certificatesResolvers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  letsencrypt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    acme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your@email.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/certs/acme.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      dnsChallenge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cloudflare</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        resolvers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.1.1.1:53'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 通配符证书路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  routers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    wildcard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'HostRegexp(`{subdomain:.+}.yourdomain.com`)'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        certResolver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">letsencrypt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        domains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'yourdomain.com'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            sans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*.yourdomain.com'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"安全加固清单\">安全加固清单</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>措施</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络层</td>\n<td>零端口暴露</td>\n<td>仅通过隧道或 VPN 访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>强制 HTTPS</td>\n<td>HSTS + TLS 1.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证层</td>\n<td>多因素认证</td>\n<td>Cloudflare Access + MFA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>强密码 + 2FA</td>\n<td>每个服务独立密码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控层</td>\n<td>异常告警</td>\n<td>登录失败通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>备份层</td>\n<td>加密备份</td>\n<td>配置文件加密存储</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"混合访问策略\">混合访问策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"外部访问（公网）:&#10;  └── Cloudflare Tunnel → 需要公网可达的服务（密码管理器等）&#10;&#10;个人设备访问:&#10;  └── Tailscale → 管理面板、数据库、SSH&#10;&#10;本地网络:&#10;  └── 直连 → 高带宽服务（NAS、媒体流）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>外部访问（公网）:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Cloudflare Tunnel → 需要公网可达的服务（密码管理器等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>个人设备访问:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── Tailscale → 管理面板、数据库、SSH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>本地网络:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └── 直连 → 高带宽服务（NAS、媒体流）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"故障恢复\">故障恢复</h3><p>当 Cloudflare Tunnel 断开时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>公网服务暂时不可达（安全失败模式）</li>\n<li>本地服务和 Tailscale 访问不受影响</li>\n<li><code>cloudflared</code> 会自动重连</li>\n<li>如需手动恢复：<code>docker compose restart cloudflared</code></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>免费额度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cloudflare Tunnel</td>\n<td>公网访问</td>\n<td>免费（无流量限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cloudflare Access</td>\n<td>零信任认证</td>\n<td>50 用户免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tailscale</td>\n<td>私有组网</td>\n<td>100 设备免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Let&#39;s Encrypt</td>\n<td>SSL 证书</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pi-hole</td>\n<td>本地 DNS</td>\n<td>免费开源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DuckDNS</td>\n<td>动态 DNS</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>域名与隧道配置是 Homelab 从&quot;只能在家用&quot;进化为&quot;随时随地可用&quot;的关键一步。2026 年的最佳实践是：Cloudflare Tunnel 处理需要公网访问的 Web 服务（密码管理、文件同步），Tailscale 处理个人设备间的管理访问（SSH、数据库、管理面板），纯本地直连处理大带宽场景（NAS、媒体流）。这套组合的核心安全优势是&quot;零暴露&quot;——你的路由器不开放任何端口，攻击面几乎为零，而你依然可以从世界任何角落访问自己的服务。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"域名与隧道配置","id":"域名与隧道配置"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"远程访问方案对比","id":"远程访问方案对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Cloudflare Tunnel 工作原理","id":"cloudflare-tunnel-工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"域名 DNS 架构","id":"域名-dns-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤一：域名注册与 Cloudflare 配置","id":"步骤一-域名注册与-cloudflare-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤二：安装 Cloudflare Tunnel","id":"步骤二-安装-cloudflare-tunnel"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤三：配置公网路由规则","id":"步骤三-配置公网路由规则"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤四：Cloudflare Access 保护敏感服务","id":"步骤四-cloudflare-access-保护敏感服务"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤五：Tailscale 内网组网","id":"步骤五-tailscale-内网组网"},{"level":3,"text":"步骤六：Let's Encrypt 通配符证书","id":"步骤六-let-s-encrypt-通配符证书"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"安全加固清单","id":"安全加固清单"},{"level":3,"text":"混合访问策略","id":"混合访问策略"},{"level":3,"text":"故障恢复","id":"故障恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"Docker Compose 服务栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services/docker-compose-stack"},"next":{"title":"聚合多源个人数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/personal-api-orchestration/aggregate-multi-source-data"}}